A Locus is a singularity of immense magical power that can rotate a traveller along the Ennaract. The architect of the [[Geography/Ushas/Undermountain|Undermountain]] spent his life to make one, and it sent the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] into the [[Geography/Ushas/Far Realms|Far Realms of Ushas]].
